- **Idempotency guard satisfied by incomplete work**: line 82.  
  Exact input: `{"published_comparison":{"reviews":[{"pmid":"39286810","citation":"C","scope":"S","how_it_differs_from_ours":"H","trial_set":"ten studies"}]}}` in `ssot/t/t.json`, run without `--apply`.  
